comments[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-11-18T10:27:28.224Z","harness:claude-code","Implemented on branch feat/sdk-stable-consumer-classifications, together with pm-5kfzjh. checkGithubUpdate's default runner no longer goes through runGitCommand. runGitUpdateQuery runs git ls-remote under the shared runBoundedUpdateQuery deadline, with GIT_TERMINAL_PROMPT=0 and GCM_INTERACTIVE=never. It reports github_remote_lookup_timed_out with update_check_timeout_ms when the deadline passes, and github_remote_lookup_failed for any other failure, never git's command line, the repository URL or stderr. An injected runner now has the npm runner's signature (args, timeoutMs). no_remote_reference_found and missing_installed_commit are unchanged. Tests are in tests/unit/extensions/npm-update-check-timeout.spec.ts (the GitHub describe block) and the existing annotated-tag case in extension-command.spec.ts.\n"
